sequenceDiagram
participant C as 调用方
participant H as HttpClient
participant Q as QNetworkAccessManager
participant R as QNetworkReply + QTimer
participant S as HTTP 服务
C->>H: postJson(url, body, timeoutMs)
H->>Q: post(JSON request)
Q->>R: create reply
H->>R: start per-request timer
H-->>C: requestId
Q->>S: HTTP POST
alt HTTP 响应完成
S-->>R: status + response bytes
R-->>H: finished()
H->>R: stop timer, read body, deleteLater()
H-->>C: succeeded(id, status, JSON) or failed(id, message, status)
else 请求超时
R-->>H: timer timeout
H->>R: mark timeout, abort()
R-->>H: finished()
H-->>C: failed(id, timeout, status)
end
